<title>Singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 20.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   92/94     99/101    UNQ    158/160</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  95/97    101/103  175/180  185/190</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes steadied on Friday on poor demand and dull trade, traders said. &quot;Trade was slow despite current depressed prices,&quot; said one major. &quot;Some of the demand has shifted to South Korea and the pre-weekend mood did not help matters,&quot; said another trader.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
